      "title": "Will AI take your job in the next 10 years? Wrong question ",
      "slug": "vinciane_beauchene_will_ai_take_your_job_in_the_next_10_years_wrong_question",
      "description": "As AI agents take over more tasks at work, the question isn’t whether or not humans matter — it’s how we make our impact count. Leadership expert Vinciane Beauchene challenges some commonly held assumptions about how AI will transform the workplace, sharing a blueprint for leaders to design organizations where people can focus on what truly makes a difference.",
